<urn:usf:schema:checked-candidate-execution-intent:1> <urn:usf:predicate:authorityRule> "intentDigest is the canonical digest of every field except state, receiptDigest and intentDigest. executionInputDigest is the canonical digest of the graph-derived candidate, validation and execution-authority binding fields. receiptPath is .usf/receipts/check/<candidateDigest hex>/<canonicalDigest(validationObligationIri) hex>.json, where canonicalDigest receives the IRI string, not an object. intentPath is receiptPath with .json replaced by .intent.json. receiptDigest is null unless state is SETTLED; SETTLED requires the exact authenticated CheckedCandidateReceipt digest at receiptPath." <urn:usf:graph:check-execution-intent> .
<urn:usf:rule:completion-check-receipts-execution-intent:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:CliFieldDerivationRule> <urn:usf:graph:check-execution-intent> .
